    {
        "content": "<p>Isn't this called Leaff, aka Lean diff?<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VkKfIWoM3Ms\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VkKfIWoM3Ms</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/alexjbest/leaff\">https://github.com/alexjbest/leaff</a></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-video message_inline_image\"><a data-id=\"VkKfIWoM3Ms\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VkKfIWoM3Ms\"><img src=\"https://uploads.zulipusercontent.net/f41e2f66a3b78ff5115a789cf8b71738a05df7be/68747470733a2f2f692e7974696d672e636f6d2f76692f566b4b6649576f4d334d732f6d7164656661756c742e6a7067\"></a></div>",
